==Trivia==
*This stage has the highest [[Cat Energy|energy]] cost in the game, standing at 1,000.
*The name "Seven Lights of Doom" may be referring to the seven different behemoth enemies appearing in this stage, as well as the fact it drops rainbow-colored Epic Behemoth Stones.

